<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1)tThe above consolidated results  were reviewed  by the  Audit Committee  and approved by the Board  of Directors at their meeting held on 27.06.2020.   n ttttttt   n2)tThe Company is engaged only in Textile business and there are no separate reportable segments as per Ind AS 108.tt   n ttttttt   n3)tThe figures of last quarter for the current year and for the previous year are the balancing figures between the audited figures in respect of the full financial   n tyear ended 31st March and the unaudited published year-to-date figures upto the third quarter ended 31st December, which were subjected to limited review.  n ttttttt   n4)tEffective April 1,2019 the Company has adopted IND AS 116 'Leases' and applied the same on all lease contracts existing on April 1,2019 using   n tmodified retrospective approach. Under this approach Right-to-Use Asset and corresponding Lease Liability have been recognised at Rs.6251.68 Lacs  n t as at April, 1 2019.  Accordingly the comparatives figures have not been retrospectively adjusted. In the statement  of Profit and Loss for the current   n tperiod, the nature of expenses in respect of operating leases are recognised as amortisation of right-of-use of assets and finance cost as compared to   n tlease rent in previous periods, and to this extent results for the current period are not comparable.tttt   n ttttttt(Rs. In Lakhs)  n tParticularstQuarter Ended 31.03.2020  n (Erstwhile basis)tQuarter Ended 31.03.2020  n (As per                Ind As 116)tIncrease/ (Decrease) in ProfittYear ended 31.03.2020  n (Erstwhile basis)tYear  Ended 31.03.2020  n (As per                Ind As 116)tIncrease/ (Decrease) in Profit  n ttttttt  n tOther Expensest9,061t8,796t               265 t37,884t36,594t1290   n tFinance Costt847t936t                (89)t3,835t4,301t(466)  n tDepreciation and Amortisationt1,641t1,765t              (124)t6,211t7,304t(1093)  n tProfit Before Taxt2,926t2,978t52 t8,785t8,516t(269)  n tProfit After Taxt2,236t2,275t39 t7,125t6,925t(200)  n ttttttt   n5)tThe Company elected to exercise the option permitted under section 12BAA of the Income Tax Act,1961 as introduced by taxation law (Amendment) Act 2019,  n tAccordingly the Company has recognised Provision for Income Tax for the Year ended March 31, 2020 and re-measured its Deferred Tax Liability (Net) based  n ton the rate prescribed  in the said Act. tttttt   n ttttttt   n6)tCovid-19 has impacted the normal business operations of the Company since March 2020 by way of interruption in production, sales and other activities.The   n tCompany is closely monitoring the impact on various aspects of its business including its Customers / Vendors / Employees and other business partners.The   n tCompany has made assessment of liquidity position for the F.Y. 2020-21 including recoverability of carrying value of its assets such as loans, Investment,  n tInventories, receivables etc.  The Company expects to fully recover the carrying amount of these assets. The impact assessment of Covid – 19 is an ongoing  n tprocess and may be different from that envisaged as at the approval of these financial results given the uncertainties associated with its nature and duration   n tand the Company will continue to monitor all material changes to the entity’s environment.tttt   n ttttttt   n7)tThe Company has declared and paid Interim / Special dividends aggregating to Rs 8.60 (430%) per equity share of Rs 2 each. The cash outgo on account of  n t Interim / Special dividends including dividend tax was Rs.48.60 Crore. No final dividend has been recommended by the Board.tt   n ttttttt   n8)tThe previous period figures have been regrouped/rearranged wherever necessary.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
